Z||000006||RiceCooker||11-07-2000||07:39 PM||||I Have them too!<BR>Mine are 16" TSW Blade's and those look like 17's.<P>Damn! I wish I could post my pics but I am a computer retard!<P>Anyways, I got mine in January. I talked to a guy at TSW and he assured me that they were discontinued (Why the He!! would they do That!?!?) and sent me to their closest distributor. They had a few sets left so basically, they are out there but you just have to find them. (They are definitely worth it) My 16's look super kicka$$ but I think the 17's look even better, so go for them if you can.<P><BR>Hey!, maybe if we get 50 or 100 people to write TSW, they will bring back the Blades.||||reg||1
